.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt CLAUDEX 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm claudex
.Nd use ChatGPT models with Claude Code
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar command
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
connects Claude Code to models available through a configured ChatGPT profile.
The proxy listens on the local computer.
.Pp
Run
.Nm
without a command to show the proxy status and default profile.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm cli Op Ar claude-arguments
Start the proxy if needed and launch Claude Code, passing arguments through to
Claude Code.
.Cm run
is an alias.
Claudex options use the prefixes
.Fl -proxy-profile ,
.Fl -proxy-model ,
.Fl -proxy-effort ,
.Fl -proxy-map ,
.Fl -proxy-port ,
and
.Fl -proxy-saved .
Use
.Fl -proxy-help
for their usage.
.It Cm desktop Op Ar options
Start the proxy if needed and open Claude Desktop.
.It Cm serve Op Fl -foreground Op Ar options
Start the proxy in the background.
With
.Fl -foreground ,
run the proxy in the current terminal.
.It Cm stop Op Fl -port Ar port
Stop the running proxy on the selected port.
.It Cm status Op Fl -port Ar port
Show the proxy status and default profile.
.It Cm login Ar profile
Sign in to a named ChatGPT profile in a browser.
.It Cm use Ar profile
Select the default profile for new launches.
.It Cm profiles
List saved profiles.
.It Cm logout Ar profile
Sign out of a profile.
.It Cm remove Ar profile
Remove a saved profile.
.It Cm models Op Fl -profile Ar profile Op Fl -map Ar path
Show model routes and context windows.
.Fl -available
queries the account catalog and
.Fl -example
prints the bundled model map.
.It Cm configure Op Cm desktop Op Fl -port Ar port
Configure plain Claude Code or Claude Desktop for the proxy.
.It Cm unconfigure
Restore Claude Code settings from before configuration.
.It Cm update
Update a bundle installed by the Claudex installer.
.It Cm license
Print the full Claudex license.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -profile Ar name
Select a saved ChatGPT profile.
.It Fl -model Ar alias
Select a model route from the YAML map.
.It Fl -effort Ar level
Set reasoning effort to low, medium, high, xhigh, or max.
.It Fl -map Ar path
Use a YAML model map at the given path.
.It Fl -port Ar port
Select the loopback port.
The default is 8765.
.It Fl -saved
Use saved proxy launch options.
.It Fl -version
Show the version and repository URL.
.It Fl -help
Show command help.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.local/share/man/man1/claudex.1
Manual page installed by the Unix release installer.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Lk https://github.com/nyorf/claudex
